WEBVTT

00:00:06.224 --> 00:00:08.117
<v><b>Hartley’s wife:</b></v> My mother’s here.

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:10.614
But she’s leaving in half an hour.

00:00:11.334 --> 00:00:14.939
She came to have dinner, but there’s nothing to eat.

00:00:18.209 --> 00:00:19.369
<v><b>Hartley:</b></v> I have something to tell you.

00:00:31.128 --> 00:00:33.840
<v><b>Hartley’s wife:</b></v> Oh, Mother! What do you think?

00:00:34.242 --> 00:00:36.576
Vivienne is coming to be our cook!

00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:40.127
She is the cook that was with the Montgomerys.

00:00:40.671 --> 00:00:43.070
She’s going to be ours!

00:00:45.934 --> 00:00:51.836
And now, dear, you must go to the kitchen and tell Héloise to leave.

00:00:52.397 --> 00:00:54.725
She’s been drunk again all day.